{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What perchance is Smush Bois about? \ud83e\udd14</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this infinitely looping platforming fighting game, you cannot jump, only smush.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Smushing? \ud83e\udd22</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smushing is the main thing you do in this game. It allows you to kill. Any unlucky fruits (tomatoes \ud83d\udc4f are \ud83d\udc4f fruits \ud83d\udc4f) caught in the crossfire will be summarily SMUSHED. You can also kill by dashing into other fruits, or by using poop, bombs, and other character-specific abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and 1v1v1 and 1v1v1v1 local multiplayer battles... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychedelic + 2D pixelated graphics...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make yuri about this too if you want...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters \ud83e\udebc</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomato (red) \ud83c\udf4e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomato (green) \ud83c\udf4f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gay Wario \ud83c\udf46</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other... \ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83d\udc67\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83d\udc67\ud83c\udffb</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Themes &amp; Benefits \ud83d\udcad</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irreverent humor...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is gay...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can just shut your brain off, who cares...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quotes \ud83d\udce3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game reminds me of Pizza Tower.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I don't get it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game has irreverent humor.&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackg